WEBVTT

00:27:59.812 --> 00:28:01.887
and drugs will change
the dynamics as well,

00:28:01.911 --> 00:28:05.785
because people will then know that they
are able to get treatment as well.

00:28:06.856 --> 00:28:09.948
WPR: Great. I'll be back later
with other questions I'm seeing.

00:28:09.972 --> 00:28:10.987
SB: Thanks, Whitney.

00:28:10.987 --> 00:28:11.987
CA: Thanks, Whitney.

00:28:11.987 --> 00:28:14.624
Thanks everyone watching.
Keep those questions coming.

00:28:15.104 --> 00:28:18.974
Seth, this time line,
I've been puzzled about this,

00:28:18.998 --> 00:28:21.021
because I get that
there are so many things

00:28:21.045 --> 00:28:23.755
that have to be checked out,

00:28:23.779 --> 00:28:26.182
but I still worry

00:28:26.206 --> 00:28:31.652
that the rules are not
adapting rapidly enough